BT 1 0 0 1 0 91.8 Tm /F1 10.4 Tf 14.6 TL (Sherry Marcus, Ph.D., is Head of Artificial Intelligence at Tradeweb Markets, where she leads the next generation) Tj T* (of the firm\222s AI strategy, enhancing price discovery, dealer selection, and analytics for more than 3,000) Tj T* (institutional clients around the world. She joined Tradeweb from Amazon Web Services, where she led the) Tj T* (300-person science and data team behind Amazon Bedrock, Amazon\222s flagship generative AI platform.) Tj T* (Previously, she was a Managing Director for Data and AI at BlackRock, where she created a global AI office and) Tj T* (led the AI Leadership and Transformation team; Chief Data Analytics Officer at Millennium Partners; and Global) Tj T* (Head of Big Data Analytics at Credit Suisse.) Tj T* ET
